y —\nand even though I’m far away,\nI still hear its leaves rustle in the breeze\nand feel that same wind on my face.\n\nIf this stirs something in you…\ntell me what it reminds you of.\n\n👉 DM me if you’d like to bring this memory home.\n\n#indianart #nostalgicart #malayaliartists", "duration": 19.5, "timestamp": 1753202604, "uploader_id": "9013348568", "uploader": "Sheeba | Original Paintings | Kerala artist", "channel": "soulfulwallarts", "like_count": 11, "comment_count": 2, "comments": [{"author": "chandrika_murali2", "author_id": "60379369398", "id": "18045016202694210", "text": "So beautiful", "timestamp": 1762269890}, {"author": "g3_manghat", "author_id": "1271036618", "id": "18046234649301577", "text": "😍😍", "timestamp": 1754202542}], "thumbnails": [{"url": "https://instagram.fsyd8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/523544172_18306497521300569_9120371258687415091_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_p640x640_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6ImltYWdlX3VybGdlbi44NjQuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=instagram.fsyd8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gEQQVWtUBPBHQ6nPYGPKm9er-uF1YvFK98I37SkJVWaPsg9Dy3MVsoRGE_uk2bBzVk&_nc_ohc=4mCLGSmAnXcQ7kNvwGgqtUw&_nc_gid=wtcVQyjl9_ZQsj2EqgBNcg&edm=ANTKIIoBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af-fXdG2lWW7tZbwDdIsy-w2ifGhl_4zuu7bkNVKGyt5FA&oe=6A2B1364&_nc_sid=d885a2", "width": 640, "height": 1137, "id": "0", "resolution": "640x1137"}, {"url": "https://instagram.fsyd8-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/523544172_18306497521300569_9120371258687415091_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_p750x750_tt6&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6ImltYWdlX3VybGdlbi44NjQuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuYzIifQ&_nc_ht=instagram.fsyd8-1.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gEQQVWtUBPBHQ6nPYGPKm9er-uF1YvFK98I37SkJVWaPsg9Dy3MVsoRGE_uk2bBzVk&_nc_ohc=4mCLGSmAnXcQ7kNvwGgqtUw&_nc_gid=wtcVQyjl9_ZQsj2EqgBNcg&edm=ANTKIIoBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_Af-No3z_-HOsB_ex9naWeCwpDMCXf43WrqJDppU-ehZjdQ&oe=6A2B1364&_nc_sid=d885a2", "width": 750, "height": 1333, "id": "1", "resolution": "750x1333"}, {"url": "ht